---
description: Project rules for the BOS school website
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow AGENTS.md at the repo root before making changes. Key points:

- Never commit or print secrets (.env, server/.env, API keys, database URLs).
- Every /api/admin/* route uses requireAdmin; SQL is always parameterised.
- Mobile first: must work at 360px width.
- Admin-editable content is read through useSiteContent() / useGallery(), not directly from src/data/site.ts.
- User-facing t("...") strings need English and Hindi entries in src/lib/i18n.tsx.
- Run `npm run check` before finishing.
